1. 禁止移植：未经书面许可，不得移植到其他游戏/平台/引擎/版本，或制作
   "移植版""搬运版"并发布。
   No porting: this project and its derivative works may not be ported to
   any other game, platform, engine or build, nor republished as a
   "ported"/"re-uploaded" edition, without the author's written permission.

2. 禁止再分发修改版：未经书面许可，不得以任何形式再分发本模组的修改
   版、二次开发版或整合改版。
   No redistribution of modified builds: modified, re-developed or
   re-packaged builds may not be redistributed in any form without written
   permission.

3. 禁止抹除版权信息。
   No removal or alteration of copyright notices.

4. 禁止未经许可的商业使用。
   No commercial use without written permission.

源码本身公开，但派生发布受上述限制。
The source itself is public, but derivative distribution remains restricted
